> Module Section3301
> Using Definitions as W
> Using Section3306 as S3306

```catala-metadata
declaration scope UnemploymentTax:
  input world content W.World
  input employer content W.Entity
  input period content W.TaxPeriod
  wages scope S3306.EmployerAndWages
  output taxable_wages content money
  output tax content money
```

§3301. Rate of tax

There is hereby imposed on every employer (as defined in section 3306(a)) for each calendar year an excise tax, with respect to having individuals in his employ, equal to 6 percent of the total wages (as defined in section 3306(b)) paid by such employer during the calendar year with respect to employment (as defined in section 3306(c)).
<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section3301:b0003; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section3301; source-lines: 3-3; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
scope UnemploymentTax:
  definition wages.world equals world
  definition wages.employer equals employer
  definition wages.period equals period
  definition taxable_wages equals wages.taxable_wages
  definition tax equals
    if wages.is_employer then round of (6% * taxable_wages) else $0
```
